---
config:
  look: neo
  theme: redux-color
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 18px
  sequence:
    showSequenceNumbers: true
    wrap: false
    messageFontSize: 17
    noteFontSize: 16
    actorFontSize: 18
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Administrador
  participant T@{ "type": "boundary" } as AdminReportDetailScreen
  participant A@{ "type": "control" } as routes/reportRoutes.js
  participant R@{ "type": "entity" } as reportsRepository.js
  participant O@{ "type": "control" } as services/moderation.js
  participant L@{ "type": "entity" } as adminRepository.js
  participant D@{ "type": "database" } as PostgreSQL
  Note over M,D: FP = fluxo principal · FA = fluxo alternativo (volta ao principal) · FE = exceção (encerra o caso)
  M->>T: navigate('AdminReportDetail', { reportId }) → load()
  T->>A: adminGetReport(id) → GET /admin/reports/:id
  A->>R: get(id), describeTarget(type, id), listForTarget(...)
  R->>D: SELECT reports / alvo
  A-->>T: denúncia + conteúdo atual
  M->>T: onPress={start}
  T->>A: adminStartReport(id) → POST /admin/reports/:id/start
  A->>R: startReview(id, adminId)
  M->>T: setAction(id), onPress={() => decide('upheld')}
  T->>A: adminDecideReport(id, { decision, action, note })
  A->>A: decideSchema.parse(req.body)
  alt FE1 · já decidida (409) ou ação inválida / procedente sem ação (400)
    A-->>T: 409 'Esta denúncia já foi analisada.' / 400
  else FP · decisão válida
    Note over A,O: FA1 · improcedente (decision = dismissed): pula a ação de moderação<br/>e só registra a decisão (passos seguintes)
    alt procedente · action = remove_content
      A->>O: removeContent(adminId, { type, id, reason })
    else action = warn_author
      A->>O: warnUser(adminId, { userId, reason })
    else action = deactivate_user
      A->>O: deactivateUser(adminId, { userId, reason })
    end
    O->>L: logAction(adminId, ...)
    A->>R: decide(id, { adminId, status, action, note })
    A->>L: logAction(adminId, { action: 'report_upheld' })
    opt FA2 · remover conteúdo ou desativar: fecha as demais denúncias do alvo
      A->>R: closeOthersOnTarget(type, targetId, id, ...)
    end
    A->>D: repo.createNotification(reporterId, ...) para cada denunciante
    A-->>T: 200 { data: { ...report, closed_together } }
    T-->>M: load() → report.status = 'upheld'
  end
